# Socratic-Trade: Cursor cloud Infisical defaults (no secret values, no project IDs).
# Long-lived credentials and project selectors belong in Cursor dashboard Secrets:
#   INFISICAL_CLIENT_ID, INFISICAL_CLIENT_SECRET (required for secret injection)
#   INFISICAL_PROJECT_ID (app project uuid)
#   INFISICAL_SHARED_PROJECT_ID (only when INFISICAL_SHARED_CLIENT_ID + SECRET are set)
#   INFISICAL_SHARED_CLIENT_ID, INFISICAL_SHARED_CLIENT_SECRET (optional shared overlay)
INFISICAL_ENV=dev
INFISICAL_DOMAIN=https://app.infisical.com
